{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49726","headline":"後庭花 一 · 孙光宪","name":"後庭花 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"景阳钟动宫莺转，露凉金殿。\n轻飙吹起琼花绽，玉叶如剪。\n晚来高阁上，珠帘卷。\n见坠香千片，修蛾慢脸陪雕辇，後庭新宴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}